      "side": 1,
      "message": "The purpose of this launcher_score patched method is to force the requests to be handled by launcher0 where we\u0027ve also patched _acceptRequest in order to control the order things are handled in right?\n\nAt first I was wondering why this was necessary at all since launcher0 is already patched, but we\u0027re trying to avoid also managing launcher1 state I think.",
      "revId": "7b02b6ade1f123165d3879cbdf0ffb886595309c",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
    },
